{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/e67049f9a05c6266b3466ae1178ec25a.poster.avif?t=1758025839\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/e67049f9a05c6266b3466ae1178ec25a.webm?t=1758025839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/e67049f9a05c6266b3466ae1178ec25a.mp4?t=1758025839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish Stick Protocol is a coop online game where you and your friends play as these cute little guys who get tossed into random hostile dimensions. Your job is simple: grab as many shiny artifacts as you can to decorate your boss's manor. Ideally, don\u2019t die.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dimensions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can have access to dimensions up to hostility 3, with even a few exotic ones if you're lucky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/f0b431747eb82c68a7d2c9a90e7b5a94.poster.avif?t=1758025839\" width=800 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/f0b431747eb82c68a7d2c9a90e7b5a94.webm?t=1758025839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy consumable tools to use in dimensions. Two tools are available, plus the fun party popper. The more advanced tools are not available in the demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/405d9ba729e529c218dfe954f13403a9.poster.avif?t=1758025839\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/405d9ba729e529c218dfe954f13403a9.webm?t=1758025839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/405d9ba729e529c218dfe954f13403a9.mp4?t=1758025839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hub equipment (upgrades)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy upgrades for the hub area.   <br> <br><strong>Unlockable</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling machine,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some storage shelves,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paint showers,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Not in demo</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevator,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Most storage shelves,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleaning machine,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundboard,</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/b8ba30d9b0a212dbce9569e5babeabd4.poster.avif?t=1758025839\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/b8ba30d9b0a212dbce9569e5babeabd4.webm?t=1758025839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manor</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The entrance / lobby are accessible at start. The main hall can be unlocked. The rest of the Manor rooms are locked in demo. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/4a1b961a49146da6b31f7418991df69b.poster.avif?t=1758025839\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/4a1b961a49146da6b31f7418991df69b.webm?t=1758025839\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/4a1b961a49146da6b31f7418991df69b.mp4?t=1758025839\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cosmetics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cosmetic shop won't be in the demo at all on September 24th.</strong> Later on, the shop will be accessible with a short selection of hats, charms, and one backpack. Most of the cosmetic items will be locked in the demo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3701430?t=1758025839","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/7885d2f3bd3d93113f41ea046533134e8d292467/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758025839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/0ddf1728d00462c92570df33af1c0168fb7b4d4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758025839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/0ddf1728d00462c92570df33af1c0168fb7b4d4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758025839","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701430/extras/e67049f9a05c6266b3466ae1178ec25a.poster.avif?t=1758025839\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap